          "expr": "1 - ((sum by (app) (increase(http_server_requests_total{namespace=\"sample-app\", app=~\"$app\", code=~\"5..\"}[30d])) / sum by (app) (increase(http_server_requests_total{namespace=\"sample-app\", app=~\"$app\"}[30d]))) / (1 - 0.995))",
